WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.875
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:07.145 --> 00:09.025
‎SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
01:35.265 --> 01:39.025
‎ADAPTED FROM ‎JIA JIN CHAI‎, ORIGINAL NOVEL ‎BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

4
01:51.345 --> 01:52.745
She…

5
01:56.465 --> 01:58.545
She's an impostor.

6
02:07.865 --> 02:12.825
She's… Not the real one…

7
02:17.425 --> 02:18.785
Why isn't the physician here yet?

8
02:20.105 --> 02:21.105
Hurry!

9
02:22.625 --> 02:23.705
Not the real…

10
02:42.425 --> 02:45.625
Grandmother. You already knew the one at the Duke's Residence wasn't the real one.

11
02:45.705 --> 02:46.785
This old woman's words were hardly needed.

12
02:46.865 --> 02:48.785
She made a grave mistake at the Wei Residence

13
02:48.865 --> 02:51.825
and hoped the Zhou family would take her in.

14
02:52.585 --> 02:54.145
To end up like this…

15
02:54.665 --> 02:55.905
She only has herself to blame.

16
03:11.265 --> 03:13.065
She is from the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence, after all.

17
03:13.665 --> 03:16.865
Send for the Wei family and have them take her away.

18
03:32.065 --> 03:33.305
Take her away.

19
03:43.825 --> 03:45.305
If you wanted to question her,

20
03:45.385 --> 03:46.665
you could've done it anywhere at Xianzhuang.

21
03:46.745 --> 03:48.025
Why take her all the way to the rear hill,

22
03:48.105 --> 03:49.305
send the guards away,

23
03:49.385 --> 03:50.345
and question her alone?

24
03:50.945 --> 03:52.945
Unless this secret has something to do with you.

25
03:53.745 --> 03:55.265
Nothing you've done tonight makes sense.

26
03:55.345 --> 03:57.625
-I shouldn't have indulged you. -Yes!

27
03:58.425 --> 03:59.585
I did it.

28
04:09.665 --> 04:11.185
You know,

29
04:12.065 --> 04:15.265
my father abandoned his wife and daughter to serve his country.

30
04:16.145 --> 04:19.105
My mother abandoned me for power and glory at the palace.

31
04:19.825 --> 04:22.265
Then there's my grandmother, obsessed with family's honor.

32
04:22.985 --> 04:26.425
They all got exactly what they wanted.

33
04:26.505 --> 04:28.105
Every one of them is selfish!

34
04:29.305 --> 04:31.585
Then why am I the one expected to be selfless?

35
04:33.665 --> 04:34.545
Yes.

36
04:35.065 --> 04:38.265
I'm spoiled and willful. I'm cruel to servants.

37
04:38.345 --> 04:39.945
I'm bad. I'm vicious.

38
04:40.025 --> 04:41.625
I've done every awful thing imaginable!

39
04:43.505 --> 04:44.865
But I'm scared.

40
04:45.705 --> 04:49.865
I'm scared she'll tell Maternal Grandmother everything I've done

41
04:49.945 --> 04:51.105
and make you all hate me.

42
04:51.705 --> 04:53.305
I won't let that happen. I won't!

43
04:53.905 --> 04:55.985
-Rao, I… -Don't you love me, Jue?

44
04:58.705 --> 05:00.825
Every year, the Huo family caravans

45
05:00.905 --> 05:02.745
bring treasures back from the Western Regions.

46
05:03.545 --> 05:05.505
You always pick the finest ones for me.

47
05:06.745 --> 05:09.065
If you love someone, you put them first.

48
05:10.105 --> 05:12.625
You have to stand by me no matter what.

49
05:13.625 --> 05:15.745
Even if you're bad?

50
05:16.545 --> 05:17.865
Even if you're vicious?

51
05:22.985 --> 05:24.465
Even if I'm vicious.

52
05:25.185 --> 05:27.865
Even if I do terrible things, you still have to help me.

53
05:29.665 --> 05:30.745
Huo Jue.

54
05:32.545 --> 05:33.905
I need you.

55
05:43.025 --> 05:46.425
DUKE'S RESIDENCE

56
05:47.505 --> 05:48.505
My Lady.

57
05:48.585 --> 05:50.905
Lady Li is watching your every move.

58
05:50.985 --> 05:52.425
You're already in danger yourself.

59
05:52.505 --> 05:54.745
How can you worry about those refugees?

60
05:55.545 --> 05:58.825
Why don't we have Liangcai quietly fetch Madam Qiao and your sister,

61
05:58.905 --> 06:00.505
and hide them somewhere safe?

62
06:01.105 --> 06:02.625
That would keep you out of danger.

63
06:04.065 --> 06:08.265
Lady Li threatened me today only to throw me off balance.

64
06:09.145 --> 06:11.425
If I send someone to hide Mother now,

65
06:12.385 --> 06:14.585
I'll only lead her straight to Mother.

66
06:16.345 --> 06:18.145
She hasn't made a move

67
06:18.665 --> 06:21.065
only because she fears the Empress Dowager and the Lu family.

68
06:23.265 --> 06:27.385
Tell me, why is everyone so afraid of Lady Li?

69
06:29.425 --> 06:31.905
Because she's the Emperor's favorite consort.

70
06:32.425 --> 06:36.705
She has the Emperor's power behind her, giving her status and authority.

71
06:37.385 --> 06:38.785
But now I have a title too.

72
06:39.385 --> 06:42.505
-But your title is… -An empty title.

73
06:43.105 --> 06:46.225
It's prestigious in name only. Unless…

74
06:51.305 --> 06:52.505
Unless…

75
06:54.425 --> 06:56.985
I become a true thane with real power,

76
06:58.425 --> 07:01.705
with the people's support and authority in my hands,

77
07:02.305 --> 07:04.385
with real power and prestige.

78
07:06.465 --> 07:10.065
Then what could a palace consort possibly do against me?

79
07:10.985 --> 07:12.665
After all, the Empress Dowager rules the palace,

80
07:13.265 --> 07:17.385
the court has its officials, and the people have a voice.

81
07:21.545 --> 07:23.905
She can't rule over everyone yet.

82
07:31.265 --> 07:32.985
The 500 mu refers to fertile farmland.

83
07:33.065 --> 07:35.425
Beyond the hills, there's still plenty of uncultivated wasteland,

84
07:36.025 --> 07:37.225
about another 500 mu.

85
07:37.825 --> 07:39.545
The harvests have been poor lately.

86
07:39.625 --> 07:41.065
Hutuo has kept raiding the border.

87
07:42.585 --> 07:44.465
Refugees are coming nonstop from the north.

88
07:45.665 --> 07:47.105
Why not clear more land?

89
07:47.945 --> 07:49.625
The Han family has built homes all over this area

90
07:49.705 --> 07:52.145
and raised vast estates, taking on huge numbers of workers.

91
07:52.785 --> 07:54.585
The refugees all become their bonded servants,

92
07:54.665 --> 07:56.265
working for free and doing every kind of labor.

93
07:57.345 --> 07:59.025
They don't even have freedom.

94
07:59.105 --> 08:00.345
The wasteland they work so hard on.

95
08:01.025 --> 08:02.025
Who does it all end up to?

96
08:03.345 --> 08:05.585
The Han family has controlled this area for years.

97
08:05.665 --> 08:08.385
They have vast fertile lands and immense power.

98
08:09.225 --> 08:12.465
They have thousands of servants and tens of thousands of dependents.

99
08:16.025 --> 08:17.705
Will the crops grown on this land…

100
08:20.145 --> 08:23.665
also become the Han family's wealth to fund their private army?

101
08:24.265 --> 08:27.585
Exactly. He'll never give up his hold on this place.

102
08:28.865 --> 08:33.024
He'll do everything he can to drive you out for good.

103
08:34.264 --> 08:36.425
-What are you doing? -Back up!

104
08:36.505 --> 08:37.784
-Get back! -Back up!

105
08:38.385 --> 08:39.745
-Now we can't even use the well? -What are you doing?

106
08:39.825 --> 08:41.985
-You're trying to kill us! -Indeed.

107
08:42.065 --> 08:43.745
-Exactly! -That's right!

108
08:43.825 --> 08:45.545
I said you can't use it, so you can't!

109
08:45.625 --> 08:46.545
Not even a drop!

110
08:46.625 --> 08:47.625
Smash them all!

111
08:47.705 --> 08:49.465
-Stop! -Don't do this!

112
08:51.545 --> 08:52.585
What are you doing?

113
08:57.665 --> 08:58.825
Do you have a death wish?

114
08:59.585 --> 09:01.905
-Fang! -Grandpa!

115
09:03.745 --> 09:05.105
No!

116
09:13.945 --> 09:15.265
I'll kill you!

117
09:22.545 --> 09:25.025
You've gone too far! Seize them!

118
09:25.105 --> 09:26.185
Nobody move!

119
09:32.465 --> 09:34.745
Your Ladyship, please save us!

120
09:34.825 --> 09:37.425
None of us can survive like this!

121
09:37.505 --> 09:41.225
Everyone, kneel! Beg Her Ladyship!

122
09:41.305 --> 09:44.105
Kneel! Beg Her Ladyship!

123
09:44.945 --> 09:47.305
Please save us!

124
09:49.185 --> 09:52.345
Please, Your Ladyship!

125
09:55.945 --> 10:02.425
Your Ladyship, please save us!

126
10:14.425 --> 10:15.265
Han Liao!

127
10:18.265 --> 10:19.825
I'll make you and your lackeys

128
10:20.425 --> 10:22.905
run away with your tails between your legs!

129
10:22.985 --> 10:24.665
And leave this land forever!

130
10:28.145 --> 10:30.585
Did you all hear what she just said?

131
10:30.665 --> 10:32.545
Such bold words.

132
10:32.625 --> 10:34.665
I'm absolutely terrified.

133
10:34.745 --> 10:35.905
Barely made a Noble Lady,

134
10:35.985 --> 10:38.545
and already you think you're above everyone.

135
10:38.625 --> 10:44.465
I'd love to see how Noble Lady Wu'an plans to drive me out herself!

136
10:45.545 --> 10:46.625
No!

137
10:49.345 --> 10:50.545
Bullying the old and weak.

138
10:50.625 --> 10:52.305
How despicable!

139
10:53.545 --> 10:55.705
Fetch the physician. Help the wounded get treatment.

140
10:56.785 --> 10:57.705
Yes.

141
10:59.825 --> 11:01.985
My Lord, didn't you say

142
11:02.065 --> 11:04.505
Lord Han had another beautiful estate that he gave me as well?

143
11:04.585 --> 11:05.425
I'd like to see it.

144
11:06.025 --> 11:07.425
It's just ahead. Let's go.

145
11:16.745 --> 11:19.665
Keep watch. If anyone makes a move,

146
11:19.745 --> 11:21.065
tie up and send to the magistrate's.

147
11:30.745 --> 11:32.025
Keep a close eye on them!

148
11:32.665 --> 11:34.185
My Lord, should we…

149
11:34.865 --> 11:35.705
No rush.

150
11:36.305 --> 11:39.385
I control the only irrigation canal.

151
11:39.905 --> 11:42.105
What can she possibly do?

152
11:44.585 --> 11:47.745
Sooner or later, she'll come crawling back to beg me.

153
11:52.465 --> 11:53.905
All along the way,

154
11:53.985 --> 11:56.825
flowers bloom in the east, while grapevines fill the west.

155
11:57.345 --> 12:00.865
From the Lingbi stones in the garden to the golden-red fish in the pond,

156
12:00.945 --> 12:02.465
and the colorful parrots on their perches,

157
12:02.985 --> 12:05.225
every treasure here cost a fortune.

158
12:06.105 --> 12:08.105
Opulent, yet tasteful.

159
12:08.185 --> 12:10.025
Extravagant, yet full of charm.

160
12:10.105 --> 12:12.305
No wonder Han Liao knows how to please the Empress Dowager.

161
12:12.385 --> 12:14.305
He certainly knows how to enjoy the finer things.

162
12:14.905 --> 12:16.985
But this estate is yours now.

163
12:17.505 --> 12:19.265
You rarely spent time in the capital before.

164
12:19.345 --> 12:20.465
Most people don't know you.

165
12:20.985 --> 12:23.945
Use your title as Noble Lady Wu'an to invite the noble families

166
12:24.025 --> 12:25.905
and build some useful connections.

167
12:27.465 --> 12:29.345
That huge Lingbi stone we just saw

168
12:29.865 --> 12:32.185
was hauled over a thousand li from the south to the capital.

169
12:32.705 --> 12:35.145
Who knows how many died along the way?

170
12:36.385 --> 12:38.905
You said you'd drive Han Liao out for good.

171
12:38.985 --> 12:40.585
That won't be easy.

172
12:41.105 --> 12:42.585
The refugees and thugs who follow him

173
12:42.665 --> 12:43.505
will keep coming.

174
12:44.105 --> 12:45.905
The moment swords are drawn and blood is spilled,

175
12:45.985 --> 12:47.665
the Han family will have countless charges ready against you.

176
12:48.345 --> 12:50.225
They've probably already written the accusations.

177
12:50.985 --> 12:52.825
They're just waiting for you to walk into their trap.

178
12:53.345 --> 12:57.985
CAISHU HALL

179
12:58.985 --> 13:00.185
I do need to host a gathering.

180
13:01.265 --> 13:02.105
Now you're talking.

181
13:02.705 --> 13:05.665
Have the Duchess of Ying host it and invite the Eldest Princess.

182
13:06.545 --> 13:08.545
Let's see if the Han family still dares to cause trouble.

183
13:08.625 --> 13:09.465
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

184
13:09.545 --> 13:12.865
Once the Eldest Princess arrives, the refugees will vanish.

185
13:12.945 --> 13:14.065
But once the royals leave,

186
13:14.145 --> 13:18.785
they'll show up like moles all across the fields again.

187
13:20.905 --> 13:22.265
That's how ruthless Han Liao is.

188
13:23.225 --> 13:26.705
I won't invite the noble families. Nor any imperial relatives.

189
13:29.865 --> 13:31.385
Then who will you invite?

190
13:31.465 --> 13:32.425
The people.

191
13:33.385 --> 13:34.225
No.

192
13:36.505 --> 13:38.025
I'll invite the voices no one can silence.

193
13:41.385 --> 13:43.265
My Lord, these past two days,

194
13:43.345 --> 13:44.705
quite a few scholars have come to the estate.

195
13:44.785 --> 13:48.425
I cut off her canal and ruined the livelihood of the fields.

196
13:49.185 --> 13:51.545
She should be taking those refugees to petition His Majesty.

197
13:52.225 --> 13:54.025
Why is she hiding instead?

198
13:54.105 --> 13:56.185
My Lord, since the indentures and deeds are destroyed,

199
13:56.265 --> 13:58.025
why don't we just seize the estate?

200
13:58.105 --> 14:00.825
Idiot. His Majesty gave his word.

201
14:00.905 --> 14:04.185
We can't act so openly and give them grounds against us.

202
14:07.225 --> 14:08.065
Go on.

203
14:08.145 --> 14:12.545
Why has Noble Lady Wu'an gathered all those penniless scholars?

204
14:12.625 --> 14:15.145
Everyone says Noble Lady Wu'an is incredibly generous to guests.

205
14:15.225 --> 14:17.465
She holds feasts every day for anyone who comes.

206
14:17.545 --> 14:19.665
Anyone can attend. Her Ladyship charges nothing.

207
14:19.745 --> 14:21.105
She has only one condition.

208
14:21.185 --> 14:22.865
Before leaving, every guest must leave behind a work of art.

209
14:22.945 --> 14:23.905
Poetry or paintings, either will do,

210
14:23.985 --> 14:25.905
but they must praise her beauty and generosity

211
14:25.985 --> 14:27.625
and spread her fame throughout the realm.

212
14:27.705 --> 14:29.985
If the work is good, she even pays them for it.

213
14:31.025 --> 14:33.505
I thought she'd risk everything for those paupers.

214
14:34.105 --> 14:36.025
Turns out she's just chasing fame,

215
14:36.105 --> 14:38.585
feeding a bunch of freeloading parasites

216
14:39.185 --> 14:42.665
so they'll sing her praises.

217
14:44.665 --> 14:45.865
Vain and shortsighted.

218
14:46.465 --> 14:47.665
Can I go now?

219
14:47.745 --> 14:49.585
-If I'm late, I'll miss the feast. -Get lost.

220
14:52.425 --> 14:53.945
I gave her far too much credit.

221
15:17.025 --> 15:18.305
Is everything ready?

222
15:18.385 --> 15:20.865
Everything is ready as your Ladyship ordered.

223
15:24.305 --> 15:25.185
Your Ladyship.

224
15:28.785 --> 15:31.625
-Greetings, Your Ladyship. -Greetings, Your Ladyship.

225
15:34.105 --> 15:34.945
Everyone.

226
15:44.185 --> 15:45.425
Liu Ziyang.

227
15:45.505 --> 15:48.105
You're usually arrogant and think you're above everyone. Fine.

228
15:48.905 --> 15:50.425
But Noble Lady Wu'an invited you to her feast.

229
15:50.505 --> 15:53.905
You stuffed yourself, yet couldn't even thank your host?

230
15:53.985 --> 15:55.705
What kind of manners are those?

231
15:55.785 --> 15:57.225
-Exactly. -That's right.

232
15:57.305 --> 15:59.905
-It's improper. -That's hardly decent.

233
15:59.985 --> 16:02.505
Your Ladyship is certainly beautiful,

234
16:03.105 --> 16:04.505
but I see little talent or virtue.

235
16:05.025 --> 16:06.745
You earned a title without a single achievement

236
16:07.345 --> 16:08.785
and then bought yourself a good name with petty favors.

237
16:09.665 --> 16:12.705
Yet you fail to understand that the finest swords come from Wuyue…

238
16:12.785 --> 16:13.665
Liu Ziyang!

239
16:13.745 --> 16:15.745
And the finest jade comes from Mount Jing.

240
16:15.825 --> 16:17.465
A phoenix only chooses a worthy place to land.

241
16:18.265 --> 16:20.905
The wise have always followed those worthy of serving.

242
16:21.865 --> 16:24.345
Your Ladyship buys loyalty with fine wine and meat.

243
16:25.385 --> 16:27.745
All you attract are useless freeloaders.

244
16:27.825 --> 16:28.865
-You… -You!

245
16:28.945 --> 16:30.585
-And those silly verses they wrote? -What does he say?

246
16:30.665 --> 16:32.585
-How arrogant. -My advice to Your Ladyship

247
16:32.665 --> 16:34.105
is not to spread them around.

248
16:34.705 --> 16:36.705
You'll only make yourself a laughingstock.

249
16:36.785 --> 16:39.345
Liu Ziyang, who are you calling freeloaders?

250
16:39.425 --> 16:40.905
She invited you here out of kindness.

251
16:40.985 --> 16:42.465
How dare you be so rude?

252
16:42.545 --> 16:43.825
Ungrateful and shameless!

253
16:43.905 --> 16:45.225
You're a disgrace to all scholars!

254
16:45.945 --> 16:46.825
-Exactly! -That's right!

255
16:46.905 --> 16:48.705
-Shameless! -Absolutely shameless!

256
16:48.785 --> 16:50.585
-Stop. -Ashamed to be with him.

257
16:53.105 --> 16:54.145
What?

258
16:55.905 --> 16:56.945
Is Your Ladyship going to kill me?

259
17:05.825 --> 17:07.265
I made it clear from the start.

260
17:07.785 --> 17:10.825
Every scholar who attends my feast receives a parting gift.

261
17:11.745 --> 17:13.025
Please accept it, sir.

262
17:22.704 --> 17:24.145
How ugly.

263
17:25.665 --> 17:28.265
-How can he say that? -That's simply outrageous.

264
17:28.345 --> 17:29.905
-Good! nicely done! -Serves him right!

265
17:30.505 --> 17:33.065
Everyone here came to speak up for the people.

266
17:33.665 --> 17:35.505
We have no use for someone who judges by looks

267
17:35.585 --> 17:37.145
and is as arrogant as he is ignorant!

268
17:37.745 --> 17:39.025
-Throw him out. -Yes.

269
17:47.145 --> 17:48.545
-Your Ladyship! -Your Ladyship!

270
17:48.625 --> 17:54.705
-Your Ladyship! -Please give us justice! Your Ladyship!

271
17:54.785 --> 17:55.665
CAISHU HALL

272
17:55.745 --> 17:58.905
-Please give us justice, Your Ladyship! -Please give us justice!

273
17:58.985 --> 18:02.945
Your Ladyship, please give us justice!

274
18:04.665 --> 18:05.945
Please give us justice!

275
18:06.025 --> 18:07.625
Please don't kneel. If you've been wronged,

276
18:07.705 --> 18:08.665
just tell me what happened.

277
18:08.745 --> 18:10.865
The Han family cut off our only canal.

278
18:10.945 --> 18:14.745
Our crops are about to die!

279
18:15.425 --> 18:18.545
They seized our fields and took over the wells.

280
18:18.625 --> 18:23.065
More than half our livestock have died of thirst…

281
18:23.145 --> 18:24.945
Look at these wounds.

282
18:25.025 --> 18:27.425
The Han family's men did this to us.

283
18:27.505 --> 18:29.225
Please, have mercy.

284
18:29.305 --> 18:31.345
Please save us!

285
18:31.425 --> 18:35.945
Please save us, Your Ladyship!

286
18:36.025 --> 18:40.945
-Please give us justice, Your Ladyship! -What can we do?

287
18:42.865 --> 18:43.745
Your Ladyship.

288
18:44.545 --> 18:46.985
We're just poor scholars from humble families.

289
18:47.745 --> 18:49.345
We can barely feed and clothe ourselves.

290
18:50.025 --> 18:53.145
What power could we possibly have to save all these people?

291
18:57.905 --> 19:03.185
You are all learned men, the future pillars of this nation.

292
19:03.825 --> 19:05.665
Your day to soar will surely come.

293
19:05.745 --> 19:07.745
You won't be down on your luck forever.

294
19:08.385 --> 19:09.865
I'd like to do what little I can

295
19:10.385 --> 19:12.585
and provide simple meals and lodging each day.

296
19:12.665 --> 19:15.585
You're all welcome to stay and focus on your studies.

297
19:17.545 --> 19:23.945
But the grain and vegetables here are all grown by the local people.

298
19:24.545 --> 19:29.585
If they're driven to ruin, this estate won't survive either.

299
19:34.185 --> 19:37.305
So please put your talents to use and speak from the heart.

300
19:38.025 --> 19:40.665
Write poems about the people's suffering.

301
19:42.385 --> 19:44.345
CAISHU HALL

302
19:56.505 --> 19:57.585
How could I, Liu Ziyang,

303
19:57.665 --> 20:01.945
miss a righteous cause like fighting evil and helping the people?

304
20:02.625 --> 20:03.905
We don't need you.

305
20:14.785 --> 20:17.385
I was blind and foolish.

306
20:17.465 --> 20:19.865
You care for the people's suffering and hardships.

307
20:19.945 --> 20:21.065
You truly have a heart of gold.

308
20:21.665 --> 20:23.465
I sincerely beg your forgiveness.

309
20:24.105 --> 20:26.825
It's never too late to admit mistakes.

310
20:26.905 --> 20:28.065
You're defending him?

311
20:36.545 --> 20:39.145
Your Ladyship's noble heart has won my deepest respect.

312
20:40.225 --> 20:41.425
But while we're here,

313
20:41.945 --> 20:45.425
eating the grain these people grow and drinking the wine they brew,

314
20:46.145 --> 20:47.945
how can we stay silent just because we fear the powerful?

315
20:49.585 --> 20:52.065
-If you won't, I will! -Are you writing or not?

316
20:55.505 --> 20:56.385
You've misunderstood.

317
20:56.985 --> 20:59.065
I'm not asking you to risk petitioning the court,

318
20:59.145 --> 21:00.865
or offend the powerful.

319
21:00.945 --> 21:03.465
Just write a few simple rhymes or folk verses.

320
21:04.105 --> 21:09.105
Ideally, a catchy tune that even the unlettered can sing along to.

321
21:09.185 --> 21:10.385
Catchy tunes?

322
21:10.465 --> 21:11.465
So that's what she meant.

323
21:11.545 --> 21:12.545
That's easy to write.

324
21:13.225 --> 21:14.585
That's all?

325
21:16.985 --> 21:20.225
Her Ladyship asked you to write, so get to it.

326
21:20.305 --> 21:22.345
Do it well, and Her Ladyship will reward you handsomely.

327
21:25.585 --> 21:26.505
Come on, let's go.

328
21:26.585 --> 21:28.185
-Let's get ink and brushes. -I'll write.

329
21:34.185 --> 21:35.465
Everyone, please get up!

330
21:36.065 --> 21:41.985
-Thank you, Your Ladyship! -Thank you, Your Ladyship!

331
21:47.945 --> 21:48.785
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

332
21:48.865 --> 21:50.265
You've written this one?

333
21:50.345 --> 21:51.945
-Nice one. -Well written.

334
21:52.025 --> 21:54.105
-How charming. -Take a look at mine.

335
21:54.185 --> 21:56.105
-You know where to spread these? -Yes, I do.

336
21:56.185 --> 21:57.345
That's real talent.

337
21:57.425 --> 21:59.185
-Leave it to me. -What are you doing?

338
21:59.785 --> 22:01.585
-Nice. -Let's read yours.

339
22:01.665 --> 22:02.705
My Lord.

340
22:04.025 --> 22:05.705
There are places you can't get into.

341
22:05.785 --> 22:06.945
I'll have to arrange those myself.

342
22:07.465 --> 22:08.385
Leave everything to Jiede.

343
22:09.345 --> 22:10.265
Yes.

344
22:10.985 --> 22:12.705
Rao is entertaining guests inside, right? I'll go take a look.

345
22:12.785 --> 22:13.865
My Lord.

346
22:15.505 --> 22:16.345
What is it?

347
22:17.305 --> 22:19.185
Your Ladyship invited scholars from everywhere.

348
22:20.105 --> 22:21.065
Why can't I go?

349
22:21.865 --> 22:23.145
Her Ladyship said

350
22:23.225 --> 22:26.425
the Han family resents her most for taking this land.

351
22:26.505 --> 22:28.105
It had nothing to do with the Lu family.

352
22:28.185 --> 22:29.625
As long as you stay out of it,

353
22:29.705 --> 22:32.585
this remains a private feud between her and the Han family.

354
22:32.665 --> 22:34.825
If you keep getting involved with the estate,

355
22:34.905 --> 22:37.105
the feud between the Lu and Han families will only deepen.

356
22:37.185 --> 22:39.785
Besides, the hall is full of scholars today.

357
22:39.865 --> 22:41.025
If you go inside,

358
22:41.105 --> 22:45.225
people may accuse the Lu family of recruiting followers

359
22:45.305 --> 22:47.305
-for its own gain. -It doesn't sound like a ballad at all.

360
22:52.105 --> 22:54.345
Good one here. This one too.

361
22:55.025 --> 22:56.305
Mine will be remembered for the ages!

362
22:58.345 --> 22:59.865
She doesn't mind troubling Qi Zhongkai

363
23:00.545 --> 23:03.625
or dragging outsiders into this, but she's afraid of troubling me.

364
23:05.505 --> 23:07.185
How thoughtful of her.

365
23:07.265 --> 23:08.465
What a considerate wife.

366
23:10.585 --> 23:11.425
Your Ladyship.

367
23:12.025 --> 23:13.025
-Hurry! -Let her see it.

368
23:13.105 --> 23:14.065
Yes, yes!

369
23:14.625 --> 23:15.745
-Your Ladyship. -Your Ladyship.

370
23:15.825 --> 23:17.665
-Please read this one. -Mine too.

371
23:17.745 --> 23:18.745
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

372
23:18.825 --> 23:19.905
Show it to Her Ladyship.

373
23:21.025 --> 23:21.945
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

374
23:22.025 --> 23:24.665
Look at the rat. It still has skin

375
23:24.745 --> 23:27.185
Yet a man has no shame

376
23:27.785 --> 23:33.145
If a man has no shame, why does he still live?

377
23:33.225 --> 23:36.385
Look at the rat. It still has teeth.

378
23:36.465 --> 23:40.425
-Yet a man knows no bounds. -What nonsense are you spouting? Go!

379
23:40.505 --> 23:42.225
-Come hit me! -Stop talking nonsense!

380
23:42.305 --> 23:43.625
-Hit me! -Come on, hit me!

381
23:43.705 --> 23:44.545
-My Lord. -Run!

382
23:44.625 --> 23:45.505
I'll bring them back at once.

383
23:46.825 --> 23:48.545
The palace summons must be urgent.

384
23:48.625 --> 23:50.665
We can't delay. We'll go to the palace first.

385
23:51.265 --> 23:52.105
Yes.

386
23:53.745 --> 23:55.265
That corrupt official treats lives like nothing!

387
23:55.345 --> 23:56.305
A butcher!

388
23:56.945 --> 23:59.985
These rich and powerful men all treat human lives as worthless.

389
24:00.065 --> 24:01.105
Corrupt official!

390
24:04.865 --> 24:06.665
"Last year I passed Mount Yaowang,

391
24:07.305 --> 24:09.065
and heard the people's cries of injustice.

392
24:09.705 --> 24:11.585
Now the canal is cut, and many lie dead.

393
24:12.185 --> 24:14.265
The grain is stained with the people's blood."

394
24:17.945 --> 24:21.145
"The Han kitchens overflow with meat, their stables with fat horses.

395
24:21.865 --> 24:25.145
Yet the people starve, and bodies litter the fields!"

396
24:27.185 --> 24:28.585
The whole city is talking.

397
24:29.225 --> 24:31.985
They say your Han family seized the people's land,

398
24:32.065 --> 24:34.185
lives in excess while bleeding the realm and its people,

399
24:34.265 --> 24:35.225
and deceives the throne!

400
24:36.665 --> 24:38.505
So answer me, Han Liao!

401
24:39.345 --> 24:42.945
How much can one man possibly eat?

402
24:43.025 --> 24:44.425
How many beds can one man sleep in?

403
24:44.505 --> 24:47.185
How did your greed become so boundless?

404
24:47.265 --> 24:50.145
I deserve death! These are malicious false accusations!

405
24:50.745 --> 24:51.745
False accusations?

406
24:51.825 --> 24:53.385
Ten essays condemning corrupt officials,

407
24:54.065 --> 24:56.785
30 folk songs and 18 long poems!

408
24:57.385 --> 24:59.745
How vile must you be

409
25:00.345 --> 25:03.905
for the people to want to flay you and devour your flesh,

410
25:04.505 --> 25:07.785
and for all those scholars to condemn you as a corrupt villain?

411
25:07.865 --> 25:10.705
Han Liao, the people say you deserve death!

412
25:14.025 --> 25:16.105
To appease people's anger and quell public outrage,

413
25:16.625 --> 25:18.545
even if every charge were false,

414
25:19.145 --> 25:21.945
you'd still deserve death by a thousand cuts!

415
25:23.345 --> 25:25.545
I deserve death! I am guilty!

416
25:26.145 --> 25:27.145
Your Majesty.

417
25:27.225 --> 25:32.025
I'll have the canal reopened at once and compensate the injured people.

418
25:32.625 --> 25:36.025
I'll personally apologize to Noble Lady Wu'an.

419
25:38.625 --> 25:39.465
Your Majesty.

420
25:41.185 --> 25:43.945
Lord Han offered his land to escape punishment,

421
25:44.025 --> 25:46.985
then cut off the canal and ruined the people's livelihood.

422
25:48.265 --> 25:49.625
He is a criminal who deceived Your Majesty.

423
25:50.225 --> 25:51.345
Lord Lu!

424
25:52.105 --> 25:54.145
The tenant farmers rejected their new master.

425
25:54.225 --> 25:55.545
They caused the trouble themselves.

426
25:57.705 --> 26:01.745
As for cutting off the canal, I knew nothing about it.

427
26:01.825 --> 26:05.025
Powerful clans have long seized land and forced commoners into servitude.

428
26:05.105 --> 26:06.265
It's a grave threat to the realm.

429
26:06.905 --> 26:09.545
It must be punished harshly as a warning to others.

430
26:10.665 --> 26:12.705
Your Majesty, at Bailu Plain,

431
26:12.785 --> 26:14.305
the Empress Dowager's tomb is under construction.

432
26:15.265 --> 26:19.585
Why not move the entire Han clan to the counties around the tomb?

433
26:20.345 --> 26:22.785
That would also stop a few refugees from causing trouble.

434
26:23.705 --> 26:24.665
Your Majesty!

435
26:24.745 --> 26:26.825
The Han clan would gladly give our lives for the realm.

436
26:27.425 --> 26:29.385
How could we leave Your Majesty's grace?

437
26:29.465 --> 26:32.305
Building the tomb is a matter of state. Unless…

438
26:33.425 --> 26:36.425
Lord Han refuses to serve the Empress Dowager!

439
26:36.505 --> 26:37.385
Lu Zhuo, you…

440
26:37.985 --> 26:40.425
Enough. That's settled.

441
26:41.785 --> 26:44.345
The Han family has enraged the people.

442
26:44.425 --> 26:46.465
I have no choice but to punish you.

443
26:47.145 --> 26:48.865
Go outside and take 50 strokes.

444
26:49.785 --> 26:50.825
And one more thing.

445
26:50.905 --> 26:53.465
Noble Lady Wu'an spared you from hard labor,

446
26:53.545 --> 26:54.705
yet you repaid her kindness with betrayal.

447
26:54.785 --> 26:58.145
So I sentence you to serve Wu'an as a servant for one month

448
26:58.905 --> 27:00.305
to make amends.

449
27:03.185 --> 27:04.185
I…

450
27:09.265 --> 27:10.105
I accept Your Majesty's decree.

451
27:36.185 --> 27:39.385
You spread rumors to destroy everything I've built.

452
27:39.985 --> 27:43.145
Then you schemed to have my clan exiled to Bailu Plain.

453
27:43.825 --> 27:45.945
How vile and ruthless.

454
27:47.025 --> 27:51.105
But who would ever know that the honorable Lord Lu

455
27:51.185 --> 27:55.745
is actually cold-blooded and vicious?

456
27:56.385 --> 27:57.545
Han Liao.

457
28:00.185 --> 28:01.985
The night our army raided the Hutuo camp,

458
28:03.465 --> 28:05.705
who betrayed his own men for selfish gain

459
28:06.505 --> 28:10.065
and left them to die far from home, their souls unable to rest?

460
28:11.225 --> 28:14.665
That blood debt has never left my mind.

461
28:15.545 --> 28:17.465
Sooner or later, we'll settle it.

462
28:18.145 --> 28:20.665
You have no proof. It's pure slander!

463
28:24.745 --> 28:26.825
Don't celebrate too soon.

464
28:28.505 --> 28:29.465
The woman you married

465
28:30.465 --> 28:32.385
is clearly a venomous snake.

466
28:35.105 --> 28:37.345
Sooner or later, you'll die by her hands.

467
28:45.705 --> 28:46.745
No need to be jealous.

468
28:53.265 --> 28:55.225
You'll never have that luck to end.

469
29:14.105 --> 29:16.225
MARQUIS OF XITING'S RESIDENCE

470
29:25.225 --> 29:26.185
Get out!

471
29:37.145 --> 29:40.305
My Lord. Let me clean you up.

472
29:58.865 --> 30:01.145
You're the daughter of the Marquis of Andu,

473
30:01.225 --> 30:04.825
yet you spend every day cowering like you're ashamed to be seen.

474
30:06.785 --> 30:08.985
I wasted 50,000 gold coins buying you.

475
30:09.665 --> 30:12.025
You walk around looking miserable all day.

476
30:13.305 --> 30:16.225
Your whole family is useless, with nothing but empty titles!

477
30:17.945 --> 30:19.545
What good are you to me?

478
30:50.665 --> 30:51.865
My wife went to admire the moon in the garden

479
30:52.945 --> 30:54.505
and tragically drowned in the lake.

480
30:55.865 --> 30:57.785
Send word to the Empress Dowager.

481
30:59.385 --> 31:01.585
Tell her the Han family must hold a funeral,

482
31:02.305 --> 31:04.225
so our clan cannot leave the capital for now.

483
31:07.385 --> 31:09.825
As for relocating the clan and my month of servitude,

484
31:11.625 --> 31:15.025
ask the Empress Dowager to appeal to His Majesty for us.

485
31:17.705 --> 31:20.185
We'll need a little more time.

486
31:29.065 --> 31:31.225
After all, the dead come first.

487
31:34.945 --> 31:37.865
I'm sure Noble Lady Wu'an…

488
31:40.865 --> 31:42.745
will understand.

489
31:44.905 --> 31:46.265
-It looks really good. -Really?

490
31:47.785 --> 31:49.105
-Have some water first. -Three!

491
31:52.945 --> 31:53.985
Four!

492
31:54.665 --> 31:56.625
His Lordship sent me here as a martial arts instructor,

493
31:56.705 --> 31:58.145
but General Qi took all the work.

494
31:58.745 --> 32:00.665
-He even said… -Keep your stance steady!

495
32:00.745 --> 32:01.745
What did he say?

496
32:01.825 --> 32:03.665
He said this is Noble Lady Wu'an's estate.

497
32:03.745 --> 32:05.105
-Everyone must obey Her Ladyship. -Five!

498
32:05.185 --> 32:06.745
Her Ladyship asked him to find an instructor,

499
32:06.825 --> 32:08.065
so Your Lordship needn't trouble yourself.

500
32:08.145 --> 32:09.265
What kind of nonsense?

501
32:09.345 --> 32:11.465
Her Ladyship is also Lord Lu's wife. She's our lady too.

502
32:11.545 --> 32:12.665
If your orders…

503
32:12.745 --> 32:13.945
-Stop. -don't work here…

504
32:14.465 --> 32:15.825
-Six! -He's the one overstepping,

505
32:15.905 --> 32:16.745
like he's the master here.

506
32:17.505 --> 32:20.505
Those blind fools probably think he's Her Ladyship's husband!

507
32:21.505 --> 32:22.705
Hold it!

508
32:27.265 --> 32:28.745
-Up! -My Lord.

509
32:31.665 --> 32:33.025
You idiot! Can't you take a hint?

510
32:33.105 --> 32:33.945
Just running your mouth.

511
32:34.025 --> 32:35.505
And you made it worse by tattling.

512
32:36.105 --> 32:37.705
-You've really messed things up. -Keep going!

513
32:37.785 --> 32:39.385
I was only worried about His Lordship.

514
32:39.465 --> 32:40.665
-Eight! -Losing men is one thing.

515
32:40.745 --> 32:41.985
-Losing his wife is worse. -Enough!

516
32:42.705 --> 32:45.025
You haven't trained long enough! Your basics are weak!

517
32:45.105 --> 32:46.065
My Lord!

518
32:46.145 --> 32:47.745
I teach moves meant for killing on the battlefield.

519
32:47.825 --> 32:49.865
Attack. Don't defend!

520
32:50.465 --> 32:51.305
Keep your back straight!

521
32:52.145 --> 32:53.185
Nine!

522
32:55.665 --> 32:57.265
You have no idea.

523
32:57.345 --> 32:59.985
When the Han family's lands and servants were divided up,

524
33:00.065 --> 33:01.865
everyone in the capital had something to say.

525
33:02.545 --> 33:04.985
Some said the Han family were relatives of the Empress Dowager,

526
33:05.065 --> 33:07.385
and Han Liao was one of her favorites.

527
33:07.465 --> 33:09.825
They said anyone who took their land

528
33:09.905 --> 33:12.585
would be asking for trouble.

529
33:13.105 --> 33:15.545
Now His Majesty had Han Liao flogged.

530
33:15.625 --> 33:17.745
If the Han family hadn't just suffered a death

531
33:17.825 --> 33:19.225
and the Empress Dowager hadn't intervened,

532
33:19.905 --> 33:22.265
the whole clan would've been sent away to build the tomb.

533
33:22.865 --> 33:26.385
Now the talk in the capital has completely changed.

534
33:26.465 --> 33:31.105
Everyone says our Noble Lady is blessed beyond measure.

535
33:31.625 --> 33:35.585
They all change sides the second the wind shifts.

536
33:36.985 --> 33:40.985
I hear your new estate has the charm of the countryside,

537
33:41.065 --> 33:42.105
like some heavenly retreat.

538
33:42.185 --> 33:46.905
All my friends keep asking me when you'll finally host us there

539
33:46.985 --> 33:49.905
and open the estate so everyone can come enjoy it.

540
33:49.985 --> 33:51.585
Yesterday, second cousin even said

541
33:51.665 --> 33:54.585
he wants to invite some noble friends

542
33:54.665 --> 33:56.585
and hunt a few wild animals.

543
33:56.665 --> 34:00.265
They say braised muntjac gives you strength to cross three mountains.

544
34:01.025 --> 34:03.065
Let's go to the estate for barbecue and wine.

545
34:04.025 --> 34:07.265
Rao, we'll just borrow your estate.

546
34:07.345 --> 34:10.145
We'll bring everything we need ourselves. How about it?

547
34:11.545 --> 34:12.505
No, no.

548
34:13.385 --> 34:15.865
These youngsters only care about fun,

549
34:15.945 --> 34:17.784
not knowing there's more between noble families.

550
34:18.425 --> 34:20.705
Friends, foes, allies, spies…

551
34:20.784 --> 34:21.985
Everyone has an agenda.

552
34:22.065 --> 34:23.545
They're waiting to see our responses.

553
34:23.625 --> 34:26.945
So, we might as well openly invite them all

554
34:27.025 --> 34:29.425
and let them see everything for themselves.

555
34:29.505 --> 34:31.025
That makes sense.

556
34:33.344 --> 34:37.264
We're family, so we shouldn't draw lines between us.

557
34:37.865 --> 34:40.145
But this estate is different.

558
34:40.225 --> 34:43.185
Wei Rao earned it herself.

559
34:43.264 --> 34:44.905
That's not right, Sister.

560
34:45.505 --> 34:47.625
Han Liao framed the Lu family.

561
34:47.705 --> 34:51.225
This estate and its lands were compensation from the Han family.

562
34:51.905 --> 34:54.784
When Han Liao used his power to cause trouble at the ancestral temple,

563
34:55.385 --> 34:57.185
I didn't see you risk your life to stop him.

564
34:57.265 --> 35:01.065
At Xuanshi Palace, under pressure from the Imperial Family,

565
35:01.145 --> 35:03.305
I didn't see you challenge the Empress Dowager and Prince Rong.

566
35:04.065 --> 35:06.545
When the Hans cut off the water and hurt the farmers,

567
35:06.625 --> 35:08.665
I didn't see you step up and help either.

568
35:09.345 --> 35:11.345
Now that everything's peaceful,

569
35:11.425 --> 35:15.385
you either want to hunt or throw a feast.

570
35:16.025 --> 35:16.945
How can you even ask?

571
35:17.025 --> 35:18.425
What do you mean by that?

572
35:19.105 --> 35:21.785
Ask Noble Lady Wu'an yourself. This land…

573
35:22.305 --> 35:24.145
Was it really so easy to claim?

574
35:24.225 --> 35:26.785
The Duke's Residence backed her all the way.

575
35:27.465 --> 35:29.585
When the Hans caused trouble at the ancestral temple,

576
35:29.665 --> 35:31.745
which of our brothers didn't step in to help?

577
35:31.825 --> 35:33.385
-Go on, tell me. Go on! -Enough.

578
35:33.465 --> 35:34.825
Enough.

579
35:35.345 --> 35:37.025
We only meant well.

580
35:37.905 --> 35:39.785
The Han family is cunning and vicious.

581
35:40.385 --> 35:42.545
They're experts at dirty tricks.

582
35:42.625 --> 35:44.465
If we invite the noble families here,

583
35:44.545 --> 35:46.745
we'll make it clear this is Lu family property.

584
35:47.265 --> 35:49.905
That'll stop anyone else from coveting it.

585
35:49.985 --> 35:53.705
Privately, it'll still be your estate, Your Ladyship.

586
35:53.785 --> 35:57.065
We already said we'd only borrow it. Just borrowing it.

587
35:57.145 --> 35:58.345
Just borrow it.

588
35:58.425 --> 36:00.025
-Even so… -Mother, please decide.

589
36:04.465 --> 36:07.825
Rao, this is your decision to make.

590
36:07.905 --> 36:11.025
Can you handle it all on your own?

591
36:26.625 --> 36:28.705
Thank you, Aunts, for looking out for me.

592
36:28.785 --> 36:31.785
But right now, the estate is still under renovation.

593
36:31.865 --> 36:33.505
It's not ready for guests yet.

594
36:33.585 --> 36:36.705
Everyone knows the Han family built

595
36:36.785 --> 36:39.025
a lavish estate filled with grand pavilions.

596
36:39.785 --> 36:42.145
This estate even rivals an imperial retreat.

597
36:42.745 --> 36:46.505
Rao, are you just reluctant to share it and making excuses?

598
36:46.585 --> 36:48.265
You child…

599
36:48.345 --> 36:49.745
Bitao.

600
36:51.465 --> 36:52.545
Old Madam, please take a look.

601
36:54.545 --> 36:57.065
The Hutuo have raided the border repeatedly in recent years.

602
36:57.145 --> 36:58.425
War has ravaged the north.

603
36:58.505 --> 37:00.225
The people are suffering and displaced.

604
37:00.305 --> 37:01.625
When winter comes,

605
37:01.705 --> 37:03.665
even more refugees will head south.

606
37:03.745 --> 37:06.305
So I plan to build, in front of the residences,

607
37:06.385 --> 37:08.705
threshing yards, silkworm rooms, and workshops,

608
37:08.785 --> 37:09.625
along with livestock pens.

609
37:10.225 --> 37:13.185
We'll stockpile plenty of winter supplies so we can shelter more refugees.

610
37:14.145 --> 37:15.665
The estate sits at the foot of Mount Yaowang.

611
37:16.265 --> 37:19.025
This hillside must be cleared before winter

612
37:19.105 --> 37:20.825
and planted with cold-and drought-resistant fruit trees.

613
37:21.505 --> 37:23.465
The soil in this valley is poor,

614
37:23.545 --> 37:24.985
but there's plenty of sunlight.

615
37:25.065 --> 37:27.025
Next year, after improving the soil,

616
37:27.105 --> 37:28.745
we can grow medicinal herbs and flowers.

617
37:30.865 --> 37:31.785
As for these homes,

618
37:31.865 --> 37:34.385
I'll rent them cheaply to poor scholars and commoners.

619
37:34.465 --> 37:36.545
Those who can't afford rent can work it off.

620
37:37.185 --> 37:38.425
But if we do that,

621
37:38.505 --> 37:40.705
the estate won't be fit for entertaining noble families.

622
37:40.785 --> 37:42.665
If you want to be charitable,

623
37:42.745 --> 37:44.705
just give out more money and grain.

624
37:44.785 --> 37:48.265
But giving such a fine estate to those common people

625
37:48.945 --> 37:50.465
would be such a waste.

626
37:50.545 --> 37:51.785
You're the wife of a noble heir,

627
37:52.465 --> 37:54.785
yet all you talk about are fields, farms, sheep pens, and pigsties.

628
37:54.865 --> 37:56.225
People will laugh at you.

629
37:56.305 --> 37:57.145
You're far too calculating.

630
37:57.225 --> 37:59.465
Changning, watch your tongue.

631
38:00.065 --> 38:02.345
Anyone can indulge in romance, beauty, and luxury.

632
38:03.185 --> 38:06.905
But how many people today would sacrifice themselves for others?

633
38:07.625 --> 38:09.825
I think this land… I…

634
38:12.185 --> 38:15.225
Rao, with everything planned this way,

635
38:15.305 --> 38:17.705
next year the livestock will thrive,

636
38:17.785 --> 38:19.065
and the orchards will bear abundant fruit.

637
38:19.145 --> 38:22.265
Trees, thorns, mulberry, and hemp will turn this place into a market.

638
38:23.425 --> 38:24.785
This estate and its lands

639
38:24.865 --> 38:28.305
were nothing but a playground for the Han family's pleasure.

640
38:28.385 --> 38:30.385
But in your hands,

641
38:30.465 --> 38:33.225
they can finally serve a real purpose.

642
38:36.545 --> 38:37.745
Good child.

643
38:38.265 --> 38:40.745
You have vision and generosity.

644
38:40.825 --> 38:44.985
Such selflessness is truly rare. Remarkable.

645
38:45.065 --> 38:46.705
Yes. Remarkable!

646
38:47.865 --> 38:49.785
The Han family used the funeral to delay their relocation.

647
38:50.585 --> 38:53.145
I'm afraid they'll go back on their word and come back for trouble.

648
38:54.585 --> 38:57.265
So I turned this area into a training ground

649
38:57.345 --> 39:00.505
and picked some strong young locals to train so they can defend themselves.

650
39:01.105 --> 39:02.425
But I know nothing about military strategy.

651
39:02.505 --> 39:04.145
I don't know where to set up defenses

652
39:04.225 --> 39:05.945
to protect the water source and the estate.

653
39:07.185 --> 39:08.465
That's easy.

654
39:20.345 --> 39:22.705
Who knew a life of luxury and careful upbringing

655
39:22.785 --> 39:24.505
could raise someone never work and can't tell wheat from rice.

656
39:24.585 --> 39:25.545
Aim high, do nothing,

657
39:25.625 --> 39:27.345
and know nothing of the people's pain.

658
39:27.425 --> 39:29.345
Every great general's glory is built on countless bones.

659
39:29.425 --> 39:31.825
Our family's honors are built on countless soldiers' blood.

660
39:32.465 --> 39:33.865
They were all sons of poor farmers.

661
39:34.545 --> 39:36.225
You call them filthy commoners.

662
39:37.025 --> 39:38.225
Then what does that make you?

663
39:39.025 --> 39:39.945
Hiding behind our family's privilege,

664
39:40.545 --> 39:41.465
you're useless, yet you think you're better than everyone else!

665
39:42.945 --> 39:45.625
Mother, he's gone too far!

666
39:45.705 --> 39:48.385
Our brothers only wanted to go hunting and asked me to speak for them.

667
39:49.145 --> 39:51.545
It's hardly a terrible crime.

668
39:51.625 --> 39:53.065
There's no need to go this far.

669
39:53.145 --> 39:54.825
Changning only asked because she meant well.

670
39:54.905 --> 39:55.945
She didn't mean well.

671
39:56.865 --> 39:58.305
She's selfish and greedy.

672
39:58.905 --> 40:00.545
Aunts, when you married into the Lu family,

673
40:01.545 --> 40:03.065
when did we ever covet your private property?

674
40:04.025 --> 40:05.105
Lu Changning.

675
40:05.185 --> 40:07.265
Those men call themselves real men,

676
40:07.985 --> 40:08.985
yet they sent you to ask?

677
40:09.625 --> 40:11.385
-Tell them to speak to me! -Look, over here.

678
40:11.465 --> 40:12.985
My army could use a few more soldiers.

679
40:13.065 --> 40:15.785
I'll find them some real work and give them a proper workout.

680
40:15.865 --> 40:17.745
Throwing your weight around at home as the heir?

681
40:17.825 --> 40:19.345
Zhuo is right.

682
40:19.425 --> 40:20.505
That's exactly how it is.

683
40:20.585 --> 40:21.865
-But yell at his sister like that? -Exactly.

684
40:21.945 --> 40:24.665
Enough! Are you all finished?

685
40:25.225 --> 40:27.305
-He… -Zhuo, come here.

686
40:30.425 --> 40:33.785
Rao wants to train people and set up defenses.

687
40:33.865 --> 40:35.305
Isn't that your specialty?

688
40:35.985 --> 40:37.625
You're an undefeated general.

689
40:37.705 --> 40:40.425
Surely you can help your wife.

690
40:41.745 --> 40:43.665
Grandmother, you don't know her.

691
40:43.745 --> 40:45.825
She handles everything herself and hates troubling me.

692
40:46.505 --> 40:48.145
She has to actually let me help first.

693
40:48.745 --> 40:50.905
I've lived a long life,

694
40:50.985 --> 40:55.225
and I've never heard of a landowner giving his own homes to tenant farmers.

695
40:55.825 --> 40:59.105
Rao's estate is truly unlike any other.

696
40:59.945 --> 41:00.825
Come.

697
41:00.905 --> 41:02.185
You two are husband and wife.

698
41:02.265 --> 41:05.985
You must stand together and work toward the same goal.

699
41:06.065 --> 41:07.465
I want to see it with my own eyes

700
41:07.545 --> 41:11.865
as you two build this one-of-a-kind estate from the ground up.

701
41:18.745 --> 41:19.985
Careful. Don't drop it.

702
41:28.065 --> 41:30.225
Your Ladyship, we're almost done packing.

703
41:30.745 --> 41:32.585
-Load these onto the carriage first. -Yes.

704
41:33.225 --> 41:34.425
Take everything out.

705
41:34.505 --> 41:35.585
Yes.

706
41:41.185 --> 41:42.025
Rao, what's all this?

707
41:42.705 --> 41:44.025
Traveling between here and the estate every day

708
41:44.105 --> 41:44.945
isn't convenient.

709
41:45.585 --> 41:46.785
I've already spoken to Grandmother.

710
41:47.465 --> 41:48.785
I'll stay at the estate for a while.

711
41:49.465 --> 41:50.505
You're moving out?

712
41:51.825 --> 41:52.945
And you didn't even tell me?

713
41:53.545 --> 41:55.225
I meant to discuss it with you,

714
41:55.305 --> 41:56.745
but you went to the palace early this morning.

715
41:57.625 --> 41:59.105
So I had to inform Grandmother first.

716
41:59.985 --> 42:02.985
I'll make sure they're careful with everything and don't damage anything.

717
42:03.665 --> 42:04.545
I'll explain everything when I get back.

718
42:25.665 --> 42:26.785
My Lord.

719
42:28.345 --> 42:29.665
Ever since we left Xianzhuang,

720
42:30.625 --> 42:33.785
you've addressed me as "My Lord" and kept me at a distance.

721
42:35.025 --> 42:36.385
Did you think I wouldn't notice?

722
42:37.625 --> 42:39.225
You already know the truth.

723
42:39.745 --> 42:41.505
-I was never… -You are.

724
42:50.785 --> 42:53.825
Unless Noble Lady Wu'an thinks you no longer need me as your husband,

725
42:54.345 --> 42:55.665
or need my protection,

726
42:56.385 --> 42:57.825
you're free to cast aside your title of my wife

727
42:57.905 --> 42:58.785
as if it meant nothing to you.

728
43:00.025 --> 43:03.785
Open that door and walk away without any concern.

729
43:06.865 --> 43:08.985
-I… -Wei Rao.

730
43:10.025 --> 43:12.385
I never know when you're playing hard to get

731
43:12.465 --> 43:13.985
or when you're actually being sincere.

732
43:14.065 --> 43:16.825
You're unpredictable, and you read people too well.

733
43:18.105 --> 43:20.305
You like seeing me jealous over you

734
43:21.545 --> 43:22.985
because it helps keep you safe.

735
43:24.265 --> 43:25.545
You're overthinking it, My Lord.

736
43:27.265 --> 43:28.385
I wouldn't dare.

737
43:28.465 --> 43:30.345
Don't try to fool me.

738
43:30.945 --> 43:32.825
I saw through your games long ago.

739
43:35.105 --> 43:36.505
Please forgive me, My Lord.

740
43:39.025 --> 43:40.945
I've struggled all my life to survive.

741
43:41.865 --> 43:42.865
I've only

742
43:44.385 --> 43:45.825
wanted to stay alive.

743
43:59.585 --> 44:02.625
One who commands soldiers is called a general.

744
44:03.465 --> 44:05.745
One who commands generals is called a commander.

745
44:06.345 --> 44:07.385
A game of chess is like a battlefield.

746
44:07.985 --> 44:10.665
The commander is what decides victory from afar.

747
44:13.105 --> 44:14.345
You should know that.

748
44:15.345 --> 44:17.105
At a critical moment like this,

749
44:18.425 --> 44:19.585
who…

750
44:21.825 --> 44:23.545
is truly useful to you?

751
44:38.305 --> 44:40.425
The heir to the Duke of Ying, of course.

752
44:42.545 --> 44:44.665
Wei Rao's rightful husband.

753
44:46.345 --> 44:47.585
Then say it to me yourself.

754
44:49.185 --> 44:50.425
Say what?

755
44:50.505 --> 44:52.185
Say you need my protection.

756
44:52.705 --> 44:54.185
That you want to be my wife.

757
44:55.665 --> 44:59.105
You still need me just as desperately as before.

758
45:00.585 --> 45:01.705
Of course I need you.

759
45:05.545 --> 45:08.105
Without you, I'll die.

760
45:36.505 --> 45:38.265
What should you call me?

761
45:44.225 --> 45:45.105
My dear.

762
46:01.465 --> 46:03.225
I'll move there with you.

763
46:15.985 --> 46:19.425
LV LUN, GOVERNESS CHANG'S HUSBAND

764
46:24.385 --> 46:25.345
My Lady.

765
46:31.025 --> 46:36.465
As for how Chang deceived me before, I won't hold it against her anymore.

766
46:37.385 --> 46:38.465
From now on,

767
46:39.905 --> 46:41.465
you know what to do, don't you?

768
46:42.145 --> 46:44.905
Please have mercy, My Lady. Spare my life.

769
46:44.985 --> 46:46.705
From now on, whatever you command,

770
46:47.865 --> 46:49.785
I will obey.

771
47:04.585 --> 47:05.985
You may go.

772
47:09.025 --> 47:12.305
The Wei family sent men to collect Governess Chang's coffin.

773
47:13.145 --> 47:15.425
I had some important instructions to give,

774
47:16.105 --> 47:17.945
so I came myself.

775
47:18.585 --> 47:20.145
While you were gone,

776
47:20.705 --> 47:23.465
Grandmother sat in your courtyard every day,

777
47:23.545 --> 47:25.265
all day long.

778
47:25.785 --> 47:27.545
You should understand her position.

779
47:28.065 --> 47:30.345
She's not just your grandmother.

780
47:30.425 --> 47:32.625
She's also the head of the Wei family.

781
47:33.545 --> 47:37.345
If she truly loves me, why would she side with outsiders?

782
47:38.185 --> 47:39.465
Aunt Yufeng,

783
47:39.545 --> 47:41.585
I don't care for empty words.

784
47:42.185 --> 47:45.385
I only want to know what secret Governess Chang

785
47:46.065 --> 47:48.025
planned to tell my maternal grandmother.

786
47:50.665 --> 47:51.545
Well…

787
47:53.305 --> 47:55.185
What exactly did she say?

788
47:56.785 --> 47:58.145
She only said

789
47:59.425 --> 48:03.225
Aunt bribed the wet nurse to abandon me on purpose.

790
48:04.705 --> 48:06.145
But I think she was lying.

791
48:06.745 --> 48:08.145
She must have been hiding something.

792
48:13.305 --> 48:14.505
Aunt Yufeng,

793
48:15.105 --> 48:18.825
please tell me exactly what happened, word for word.

794
48:19.425 --> 48:20.825
What could there possibly be?

795
48:20.905 --> 48:25.065
She was just a greedy old woman who stole money.

796
48:25.585 --> 48:27.385
How can you believe a word she said?

797
48:28.065 --> 48:29.745
Your aunt's heart toward you

798
48:29.825 --> 48:31.585
is a hundredfold truer than any pearl.

799
48:32.465 --> 48:35.145
You can doubt anyone, but never her.

800
48:35.825 --> 48:39.065
If she found out, she'd be heartbroken.

801
48:39.825 --> 48:42.865
Aunt Yufeng, don't dodge the question.

802
48:43.585 --> 48:46.865
Governess Chang served the Wei family for years.

803
48:47.425 --> 48:49.945
She knew when to switch sides and how to flatter those in power.

804
48:50.785 --> 48:55.025
Why would she flee for her life over something as trivial as money?

805
48:55.985 --> 49:00.185
All she said was that the wet nurse abandoned Rao.

806
49:00.745 --> 49:03.105
She never said what happened after that.

807
49:04.265 --> 49:06.305
A child vanished for an entire year.

808
49:06.825 --> 49:08.265
What could she have gone through?

809
49:08.825 --> 49:11.625
Why were the wet nurse and guards ambushed and killed?

810
49:12.305 --> 49:14.065
Were they killed to silence them?

811
49:16.665 --> 49:18.625
-Unless the child they brought back was… -Enough!

812
49:28.265 --> 49:32.145
Child, let me give you some advice.

813
49:33.705 --> 49:36.465
Stop digging into the distant past.

814
49:37.105 --> 49:39.985
Let the past stay buried.

815
49:40.905 --> 49:42.025
Digging any deeper…

816
49:44.065 --> 49:45.105
will do you

817
49:46.265 --> 49:48.345
no good at all.

818
49:48.945 --> 49:50.265
Do you understand?

819
49:56.865 --> 49:57.865
Good girl.

820
49:59.185 --> 50:02.105
Forget about Governess Chang.

821
50:02.825 --> 50:04.625
Pretend you never met her.

822
50:04.705 --> 50:06.625
Those questions in your heart,

823
50:07.865 --> 50:10.265
bury them deep inside.

824
50:11.385 --> 50:12.585
Forever.

825
50:13.425 --> 50:15.345
Never, ever ask them out loud.

826
50:18.105 --> 50:23.025
If anything troubles you, go to your aunt for advice.

827
50:24.025 --> 50:27.225
Everyone in this world may hurt you.

828
50:29.185 --> 50:30.505
But she alone…

829
50:32.585 --> 50:34.825
will protect you.

830
53:01.945 --> 53:03.905
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED ‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
